Subject: [PATCH 09/10] rootfs: install the AYANEO 3 udev rule in the install
 target

70-ayaneo-modules.rules has been in the tree since #536 but the install
target never installs it, so make install (and packages built from it)
ship without it. Add it to install/uninstall, matching the systemd user
unit pattern, so the AYANEO 3 plugin's eject/reset/controller_power sysfs
attributes are writable out of the box.
---
 rootfs/Makefile | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/rootfs/Makefile b/rootfs/Makefile
index c7a8bfade..b33eafc62 100644
--- a/rootfs/Makefile
